    <innerclass refid="classterminal_1_1_skit" prot="public">terminal::Skit</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceterminal">terminal</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classImage" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Image</ref> decode and SKiT filepath handler. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Encapsulates Sixel, Kitty, and iTerm2 image decoding plus the SKiT filepath preview protocol. Owned by Processor. Receives raw payloads from Video&apos;s DCS/APC/OSC handlers and fires events with decoded results.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Thread model</title><para>All methods are <bold>READER THREAD</bold> only. <computeroutput>setCellSize()</computeroutput> is called by <computeroutput>Processor::process()</computeroutput> on the reader thread when Model&apos;s cell dimension atomics differ from Video&apos;s cached values.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>SixelDecoder </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>KittyDecoder </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>ITerm2Decoder </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
